WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:02.880
- I'm Jakeem Grant, I play
for the Miami Dolphins,

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:04.350
and this is "Start, Bench, Cut."

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:05.850
I've been given three options,

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:08.580
one to start, one to bench and one to cut.

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:10.245
Gotta get up outta here.

00:00:10.245 --> 00:00:12.828
(Upbeat music)

00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:16.310
Start "Friday Night Lights,"

00:00:16.310 --> 00:00:19.497
bench "Remember the Titans"

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:22.030
and cut "Rudy."

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:23.760
It was just about one person, man,

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:24.986
it was just about Rudy,

00:00:24.986 --> 00:00:28.757
and I know it's all of that, but

00:00:28.757 --> 00:00:31.040
"Remember the Titans"
and "Friday Night Lights,"

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:32.370
it was about the team,

00:00:32.370 --> 00:00:35.370
and I'm a team player,
so I had to cut "Rudy."

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:37.660
And then "Friday Night
Lights" start, because

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:40.280
I'm from Texas and it's in Texas.

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:41.457
Starting "Madden,"

00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:44.900
rephrase that, no I'm not, no I'm not,

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:46.490
I'm starting "Call of Duty,"

00:00:46.490 --> 00:00:47.747
benching "GTA"

00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:50.140
and cutting "Madden."

00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:52.230
Man, them rankings not real, man,

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:53.230
that's not real.

00:00:53.230 --> 00:00:55.460
I should be one of the
fastest on the game,

00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:56.670
if not the fastest.

00:00:56.670 --> 00:00:59.850
One time they did that
to my boy, Keenan Allen,

00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:00.683
that's big bro.

00:01:00.683 --> 00:01:02.640
Pro Bowl, I don't know
how many times All Pro.

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:05.250
My boy Jarvis Landry, a
whole bunch of guys, man.

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:06.329
I can go down the list.

00:01:06.329 --> 00:01:08.412
(Laughs)

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:15.157
Not like that, c'mon man (exhales).

00:01:17.330 --> 00:01:18.630
Start "Carter III," uhh,

00:01:21.700 --> 00:01:22.990
Imma bench "The Blueprint"

00:01:22.990 --> 00:01:25.760
and Imma cut "Get Rich or Die Tryin'."

00:01:25.760 --> 00:01:27.480
I'm sorry but, I mean,

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:28.990
you're talking about legends here,

00:01:28.990 --> 00:01:30.890
I mean he is a legend but, man.

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:33.000
Honestly, I wouldn't wanna cut neither one

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:34.010
of them to be honest,

00:01:34.010 --> 00:01:37.350
but I just had to pick "Get
Rich or Die Tryin'," sorry man,

00:01:37.350 --> 00:01:38.370
I'm sorry.

00:01:38.370 --> 00:01:40.060
Let's see (laughs).

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:41.980
Starting it's a blessing to be here,

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:44.868
I'm benching the name on
the front of the jerseys

00:01:44.868 --> 00:01:46.530
is bigger than the name on the back

00:01:46.530 --> 00:01:48.440
and cutting defense wins championships.

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:50.060
Even though,

00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:52.800
it's true, defense wins championships,

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:55.090
but I mean, a blessing is a blessing,

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:56.818
that's talking about God here, you know,

00:01:56.818 --> 00:01:58.770
yeah that's gonna be No. 1.

00:01:58.770 --> 00:02:00.560
And nobody's bigger than the team,

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:02.800
so I mean defense, sorry, man,

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:03.810
I gotta cut you.

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:06.832
Cause I play offense, so hey (laughs)

00:02:06.832 --> 00:02:09.653
I'm Jakeem Grant, and this
was "Start, Bench, Cut."

